They are "available for distribution" in debugged, ported source form, in
accordance with the NetHack license. Ports without binaries are "supported" as 
much as ports with binaries. Mathematically, the set "binaries available for 
the port" is a subset of "supported ports". Where "official" fits into all of
the above is perhaps just a matter of semantics.

